            🌍 ECO FUSION 360
        </div>

        <p style="letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; margin: 10px 0;">
            Certificate of Achievement
        </p>

        <h2 id="certTitle">Eco Champion Certificate</h2>

        <p>This certificate is proudly presented to</p>

        <div class="cert-name" id="certNamePreview">Eco Champion</div>

        <p>
            In recognition of a meaningful commitment to responsible plastic
            management and a greener planet.
        </p>

        <div style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #176b3c; margin: 18px 0;" id="certPositionPreview">
            Seedling
        </div>

        <p>Keep reducing, reusing, recycling, and inspiring others.</p>

        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; margin-top: 35px; font-size: 12px; border-top: 1px dashed #7eb997; padding-top: 15px;">
            <span>Eco Fusion 360<br>Smart Plastic Waste Management</span>
            <span style="text-align: right;">
                Verified Green Tokens: <strong id="certTokensPreview">0</strong><br>
                Issued for Eco Impact
            </span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="no-print" style="text-align: center; margin-top: 18px;">
        <button class="btn" type="button" onclick="window.print()">
            🖨️ Print / Save as PDF
        </button>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Physical Eco Rewards Section -->
<div class="section-head" id="physicalRewardsSection">
    <div>
        <h2>🎁 Physical eco rewards</h2>
        <p>Physical reward requests are submitted for admin review.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="rewards">
    <article class="reward">
        <span class="tag">PHYSICAL</span>
        <div class="reward-header">
            <div class="reward-icon">🎋</div>
            <div>
                <h3>Bamboo Eco Flask</h3>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p>Double-wall vacuum insulated flask made with organic sustainably harvested bamboo exterior. Keeps drinks cold for 24h.</p>
        <div class="cost">✦ 500 Green Tokens</div>
        <button class="btn full secondary" type="button" onclick="requestPhysicalReward('Bamboo Eco Flask', 500)">
            Request physical reward
        </button>
    </article>

    <article class="reward">
        <span class="tag">PHYSICAL</span>
        <div class="reward-header">
            <div class="reward-icon">👜</div>
            <div>
                <h3>Recycled Ocean Tote Bag</h3>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p>Durable heavy-duty shopping tote spun from 100% recycled coastal plastic waste. Washable and tear-resistant.</p>
        <div class="cost">✦ 350 Green Tokens</div>
        <button class="btn full secondary" type="button" onclick="requestPhysicalReward('Recycled Ocean Tote Bag', 350)">
            Request physical reward
        </button>
    </article>

    <article class="reward">
        <span class="tag">PHYSICAL</span>
        <div class="reward-header">
            <div class="reward-icon">🌱</div>
            <div>
                <h3>Zero-Waste Steel Cutlery Kit</h3>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p>Compact travel set including stainless steel chopsticks, fork, spoon, silicone straw and natural linen carry pouch.</p>
        <div class="cost">✦ 450 Green Tokens</div>
        <button class="btn full secondary" type="button" onclick="requestPhysicalReward('Zero-Waste Steel Cutlery Kit', 450)">
            Request physical reward
        </button>
    </article>
</div>

<div class="footer">
    Eco Fusion 360 · Smart Plastic Waste Management System<br>
    Reading links open publisher/platform pages. Unlocking saves access to the link in your account;
    it does not bypass a publisher's subscription or regional access rules.
</div>

</main>

<script>
// The 6 digital rewards configured with your requested titles and links
const digitalRewards = [
    {
        id: "haikyu",
